<title>USA: SpectraScience gets premarket approval.</title>
<headline>SpectraScience gets premarket approval.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SpectraScience Inc said Monday the Food and Drug Administration had given it premarket notification clearance for its fiberoptic biopsy forceps.</p>
<p>SpectraScience said the forceps are designed to collect tissue samples utilizing minimally invasive endoscopic techniques.</p>
<p>The disposable product is intended for use with endoscopic gastrointestinal and urological biopsies, it said.  </p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
